WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.409
So a combat veteran did what the RCMP refused to do.

00:00:03.409 --> 00:00:05.125
Seven million records.

00:00:05.125 --> 00:00:06.556
Six databases.

00:00:06.556 --> 00:00:07.727
Two years.

00:00:07.727 --> 00:00:11.170
Every single claim sourced from the government's own published data.

00:00:11.170 --> 00:00:13.090
If they won't investigate themselves?

00:00:13.090 --> 00:00:14.397
Then the people will.
